_pdbx_database_remark.text
;HETEROGEN
THE HET GROUP CDN WAS NAMED CARDIOLIPIN
WHICH IS A GENERIC NAME FOR THIS TYPE OF
LIPID.  THE 4 TAILS OF THE MOLECULE ARE
DISORDERED IN THE STRUCTURE AND THEIR 
EXACT LENGTH CAN NOT ASCERTAINED MAKING
IT DIFFICULT TO ASSIGN AN EXACT NAME.
;

